ee  with the vaccines coming on board but i  think we're all facing the next few  weeks and months with  a cautious optimism these nhs workers  have given their all  to save lives but that hasn't prevented  a hundred thousand deaths in this  pandemic  and a fear of how many more are to come  lisa dowd sky news south wales
 

